{"id":"613173","name":"青菜香菇馅饼","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/613173/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"青菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"15个"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"摘好的青菜，淖一下，捞出。","img":"images/613173/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"剁碎，挤出多余的水分。","img":"images/613173/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"香菇备用。","img":"images/613173/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"泡发好的香菇，剁碎。","img":"images/613173/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"葱剁碎。","img":"images/613173/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"青菜、香菇和葱放入盆中。","img":"images/613173/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加适量盐、少许五香粉和鸡精，再浇上一勺热油。","img":"images/613173/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"拌匀即可。","img":"images/613173/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"一半凉水和面，一半温水和面，用筷子搅拌成絮状，醒15分钟，揉成光滑面团。","img":"images/613173/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"搓成长条状，切成大小均匀剂子。","img":"images/613173/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"擀成圆薄饼。","img":"images/613173/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"包入馅料。","img":"images/613173/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"再擀成薄圆饼。","img":"images/613173/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"平底锅烧热，放入饼胚。","img":"images/613173/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"小火，烙至两面金黄色即可。","img":"images/613173/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品图，皮薄如纸，如图所示。","img":"images/613173/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"切一下，方便食用。","img":"images/613173/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"清香扑鼻。","img":"images/613173/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}